<title>MALAYSIA: Khong Guan suspension extended.</title>
<headline>Khong Guan suspension extended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Khong Guan Holdings Malaysia Bhd's stock suspension has been extended from Tuesday to December 2, a statement from the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>In the statement sent out late on Monday, the exchange said property-based Khong Guan is getting ready to announce the proposed acquisition of certain assets. No details were provided.</p>
<p>Khong Guan in September said it is acquiring seven hotels and a piece of land for 384 million ringgit. Its stock closed at 21.90 ringgit on November 8.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
